body='<div class="eyebrow">Learning directory</div><h1>Find your next bioinformatics lab.</h1><p class="intro">Ten existing interactive laboratories, organized around the task you want to understand. Educational demonstrations are distinct from production analyses.</p><div class="field"><label for="lab-search">Search by tool or topic</label><input id="lab-search" type="search" placeholder="Try alignment or metagenomics"></div><p id="lab-count" role="status">10 labs</p><div class="grid">'
