body+='</div><section><h2>Bring context to every tool.</h2><p>Check the lab’s assumptions and tool version. Work on non-sensitive example data; toy outputs do not validate a biological conclusion.</p><a href="/resources/downloads/reproducibility.md" download>Download the reproducibility checklist</a></section>'
