page('training','Bioinformatics and research coding training','Explore free interactive labs and request practical bioinformatics, Python or GitHub training.','''<div class="eyebrow">Education &amp; training</div><h1>Learn the workflow.<br>Understand the decisions.</h1><p class="intro">Build practical skills in bioinformatics, Python for research and reproducible collaboration. Start with free resources or tell us what your group needs to learn.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/resources/">Explore research checklists →</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/inquiry/?category=training">Discuss training →</a></div><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Start independently</h2><p>Research planning guides, practical checklists and an ungated Python starter.</p><a href="/resources/">Browse free resources</a><p><a href="/resources/labs/">Explore the bioinformatics learning directory</a></p></article><article class="card"><h2>Request a workshop</h2><p>Choose your current level, topic, preferred format and availability. Dates, seats, fees and scope are confirmed before registration or payment.</p><a href="/inquiry/?category=training&amp;campaign=workshop">Send a training request</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Train your team</h2><p>Discuss a focused session for a lab, institution or teaching group. Agree outcomes and practice requirements in advance.</p><a href="/inquiry/?category=training">Scope an institutional session</a></article></div>''')
projects=[('RNA-seq workflow','MD_RNAseq','Python and shell workflow files, QC reports, tabular outputs and a documentation portal.','Study-specific design, contribution, permissions and result interpretation need confirmation.'),('Microbiome analysis','MD_Metagenome','QIIME artifacts, diversity and abundance outputs, and Python processing scripts.','Assay design, controls and inference require review; no client outcome claimed.'),('Environmental metabarcoding','Sahil_Metagenome','R/Python analysis scripts, environment definition, tabular results and report source.','Dataset licensing, contribution and publication release remain to be confirmed.'),('De novo transcriptome evidence','Shruti_RNAseq_DeNovo','Computational audit and candidate-evidence scripts with annotation outputs.','Computational evidence is not experimental biological validation; client release required.'),('Animal image classification','GPT_VISION_FOR_Animal_Classification','Notebook and spreadsheet inventory support a computational prototype.','Notebook execution, evaluation and image licensing not independently verified.'),('Research machine learning','MD_Machine_Learning','Notebook, figures, spreadsheets and analysis archive.','Full code, leakage, validation splits and performance not verified.')]
body='<div class="eyebrow">Source-backed project index</div><h1>See the work.<br>Understand its limits.</h1><p class="intro">These existing research repositories are starting points for a methods discussion. Project-specific contribution, data permissions and rerun status must be checked before treating them as validated examples. Client outcomes, endorsements, sample sizes and performance improvements are not asserted.</p><div class="grid">'
